Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.95,0:01:50.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE screeches]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:51.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI gotta save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.43,0:01:55.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I've just gotta save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll get eaten by skysharks\Nif I don't do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.31,0:01:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SHURA]\NJudgment has been made!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were God, now you're\Nnothing! Nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't even defeat\Na priest like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NHa! Ignorant little creature.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.05,0:02:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're diving into\Nyour own watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.09,0:02:15.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE squawking]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.22,0:02:22.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NAnd now for the\NSky Knight's noble steed.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You no longer have a purpose.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Follow your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE screeches]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:37.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawking]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.83,0:02:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NI do wish that I could be there
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to watch the life drain\Nfrom your faces.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.71,0:02:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But alas, I have other\Nmatters to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.11,0:02:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the three fugitives\Nhave been captured yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.74,0:03:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could a well really be\Nthat interesting?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.06,0:03:03.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYes. Don't you think it's odd
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.94,0:03:06.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that a well would be\Nstuck under a tree?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The balance between civilization\Nand nature here is off.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.17,0:03:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, unless we find a way\Nto cross this cloud river,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll be stuck in this forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAnd we're still nowhere\Nnear where we wanna be.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIt's like the\Npeople who built this
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.20,0:03:25.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,didn't know the tree\Nwould grow to be so large.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.78,0:03:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\Nanything like it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThe island where God lives...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.25,0:03:40.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNami! Say somethin', would ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.39,0:03:52.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nshe sees up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This island... can't be...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.87,0:04:04.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NThere's no way you can win!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.54,0:04:08.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a priest,\Nand you all look so tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.38,0:04:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just end\Nthis now and die? [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take\Nanymore of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too many surprises.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow, it hurts.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of\Noptions quite soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.09,0:04:22.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's sad really.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.59,0:04:25.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your little boat has nearly\Nreached the forest's exit
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.51,0:04:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and when that happens,\Nit's all over for you! [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.31,0:04:32.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll have nowhere to go
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.56,0:04:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,unless, of course,\Nyou suddenly learn to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NYou'll wander around in\Nthis terribly unfamiliar forest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and die of exhaustion! [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.65,0:04:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NHa! Nice try!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.32,0:04:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}My turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.66,0:04:59.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SATORI]\NSphere Dragon attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.26,0:05:01.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know you can't run forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And wherever you stop,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.91,0:05:06.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the fire-bomb ball will be\Nwaiting to incinerate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:12.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.55,0:05:16.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGood, looks like\Nwe can still make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave things\Nhere with you, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.35,0:05:26.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That tree... will not\Ngive you any shelter.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's like he's reading my mind!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.15,0:05:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay outta my head\Nand quit following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.05,0:05:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]\NA wire! What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.06,0:05:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, this must be how\Nhe controls the dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:42.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:45.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.90,0:05:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NYou ruined\Nmy Sphere Dragon,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you impudent little brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.05,0:05:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get over here this\Ninstance! [grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:58.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:00.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.73,0:06:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let go of the dragon, you fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.53,0:06:25.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThere it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.05,0:06:29.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew I could find the\Nway out of this place!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.68,0:06:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! This makes\Nperfect sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think\Nof this sooner?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we fell before, it was\Nfrom a very high altitude.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's only natural that the\Nexit be at the same height.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now that I know\Nwhere the exit is,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.55,0:06:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the boat doesn't\Nreally matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.09,0:06:48.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That huge explosion\Nworries me. I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Game time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:51.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.73,0:07:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That maniac must've\Nhad a death wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. [pants]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.49,0:07:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got to intensify\Nmy training.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.34,0:07:10.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't let a weakling like him\Nget the upperhand in a fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even for a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.15,0:07:16.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That might block me\Nfrom using my Mantra!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.05,0:07:23.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's you! How are\Nyou still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(680,1053)}– [LUFFY chuckles]\N– [SATORI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NGet off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDo not let him go, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.08,0:07:31.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.96,0:07:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, where've you been?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was out cold on\Nthe forest floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where else would I\Nhave been, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.09,0:07:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... that's beside the point.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSee, the point is
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you keep saying challenge\Nthis and challenge that,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which normally\Nwouldn't interest me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, there are\Ntwo helpless ladies
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,waiting for me to\Ncome to their rescue,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I refuse to let them down.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.46,0:08:01.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'm proposing this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I think you'll like it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.80,0:08:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ordeal of love.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NThis guy's an idiot, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.60,0:08:11.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unhand me this instant,\Nyou maggots!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:14.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.41,0:08:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no honor,\Nganging up two against one!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.46,0:08:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe have no honor?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You creeps kidnapped our friends
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and tried to murder a\Nbeautiful young angel.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.59,0:08:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you accuse us of\Nnot having any honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:33.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI whimpers]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pretty amazing that you\Ncan predict our movements.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what good is that...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.49,0:08:42.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...if you do can't anything\Nto avoid 'em, huh? [chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI]\NStop! Stop, I said!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.26,0:08:51.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a priest in God's service!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not being judged by me is a\Nfirst-degree crime in Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.18,0:09:02.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attacking me means you declare\Nwar on the Almighty God Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.17,0:09:03.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a question.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.55,0:09:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you ever cook?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't have\Nto be a chef to know
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.94,0:09:11.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which dish is best served cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, this dish is\Nreally quite simple.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step one:
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.42,0:09:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,season the main course\Nwith a smattering of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, you must brutally\Nand without hesitation
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tenderize the meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.70,0:09:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI screams]\NNo! You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Please! No, don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:39.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SATORI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.46,0:09:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SANJI]\NDelicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:48.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.21,0:09:52.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NSo Gan Fall, the former God,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,made his way into\Nthe Upper Yard alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Aisa?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.67,0:10:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Two voices. They're gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.63,0:10:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your Mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're saying that\Nyou heard two voices
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.35,0:10:25.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then they\Ndisappeared suddenly?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to be honest with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA exhales]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assume that's 'yes.'
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.90,0:10:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should believe her.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.87,0:10:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ever since she was born,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she has been able to use\Nher ability of Mantra
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to sense people, even those\Nwho are far away from her.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking her gift.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure you don't hear them?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.35,0:10:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're not there anymore?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think it's stopped.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seemed like Gan Fall was\Nfighting a priest and they...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.19,0:10:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Killed each other?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.06,0:10:54.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There're only three left now.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.43,0:10:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which is good for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.19,0:11:04.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess Heaven's actually\Nanswered our prayers.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.52,0:11:08.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to crush those\Npriests once and for all.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.15,0:11:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On your feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.27,0:11:13.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're launching a full scale\Nattack on the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OTHERS grunt]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper still makes you\Nnervous, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to grow up\Nsooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.39,0:11:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]\NLaki, wait, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.35,0:11:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.61,0:11:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Gan Fall who\Ndefeated that priest!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.03,0:11:34.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are others on\Nthat side of the island
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they're the\Nones that did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.49,0:11:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NOther people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean the ones who entered\NSkypeia from the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.08,0:11:44.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know who,\Nbut they're really scary to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:48.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NI'll try.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.43,0:11:53.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now be a good girl\Nand hand over your bag.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.47,0:11:54.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NNo! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my special secret bag!\NIt has treasure in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.77,0:12:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it will have even more\Ninside when I bring it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(847.5,1053)}– Yeah?\N– Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER groans, gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened? [pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Doc! Oh! Wait, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.01,0:12:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's alive. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThis makes no sense.\NI jumped in after him.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.49,0:12:43.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I figured we'd\Nsink to our deaths.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.41,0:12:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder who could have\Npulled us out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NHey. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello? Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps, screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BIRD squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:05.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(621,1053)}– [BIRDS squawking]\N– [CHOPPER screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough with the mystery, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.67,0:13:18.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!\NTell us what you saw!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NQuit ordering me around\Nand just do what I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.68,0:13:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the\Nseashore...[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.89,0:13:25.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would one of you please help me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou're the leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you help yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.83,0:13:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The seashore?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.77,0:13:30.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYes.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.93,0:13:32.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only way we\Ncan get close enough
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to check this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause to be honest,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.31,0:13:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't believe what I saw\Nuntil I see it up close.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHe couldn't have\Nshut up any sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:45.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(642,1053)}– [USOPP] Hey! Guys!\N– [LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found the boat, but you\Ngotta move! I'm serious!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't get to it right now,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we're gonna be stuck\Non this stinkin' island!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI guess Usopp's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.18,0:13:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHe's yelling\Nsomething about the boat.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP pants]\NKick it into gear!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.05,0:14:02.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The boat's leaving this place\Nand we gotta get on it now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.48,0:14:04.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[pants]\NGet up here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.56,0:14:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just hold on to my body.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.06,0:14:06.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your what?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.98,0:14:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:13.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp... [yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.35,0:14:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I\Ncall marksmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHa! Usopp, you're my hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.94,0:14:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDo you try to kill\Nall your heroes like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.79,0:14:29.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you\Npulled this off.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.38,0:14:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, no more\Nunderestimating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh? Uh...\N– Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:34.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rope is tightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(707,1053)}– [LUFFY] Oh, no!\N– Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:45.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.09,0:14:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That... hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI will never\Nlet you forget this.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.53,0:14:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...I could've stretched my\Narm and grabbed the boat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.41,0:14:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLook, we're on the\Nboat and out of the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.41,0:15:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gurgling]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.26,0:15:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NSatori has fallen.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.73,0:15:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Losing control over his Mantra
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.57,0:15:13.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,only shows his\Ninexperience with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems the intruders this\Ntime are from the Blue Sea,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.57,0:15:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but they behave strangely.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sacrifices are now\Nmoving around freely as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.53,0:15:23.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, even if we\Nleave them alone,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.69,0:15:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they won't find their\Nway off this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOLY THE DOG panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NDo you hear the voice\Nof a sorrowful warrior, Holy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:45.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[woofs]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NIt doesn't matter how\Nmany times we walk this road.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.53,0:15:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Things always end the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.53,0:15:53.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shura defeated Gan Fall, but the\NOrdeal of Spheres was broken.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.43,0:15:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where luck will end\Nfor our new challengers.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.56,0:16:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For them to attempt to see God\Nis insolence at its greatest,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and their punishment at my hands
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.85,0:16:05.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will have things a bit unsettled\Nthis evening in the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\{\an8\}No one here gets out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\{\an8\}[FUZA screeches]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.66,0:16:14.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\{\an8\}[SHURA] The ones who escaped\Nsacrifice are off my list.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\{\an8\}It seems there are\Nothers roaming around
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.57,0:16:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\{\an8\}who are more worthy of my anger!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of you, listen up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.61,0:16:48.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today we catch Upper Yard\Nat her most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.78,0:16:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the opportunity\Nof a lifetime.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.74,0:16:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We move full speed ahead
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.99,0:16:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and don't stop until\Nwe reach God's Shrine!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And do not fear Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.79,0:17:00.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Great Warrior Kalgara\Nis our one and only savior!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.04,0:17:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only to him are we true!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NBraham!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.30,0:17:08.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.12,0:17:08.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NKamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:09.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NHmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.00,0:17:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NGenbou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.88,0:17:12.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NLaki!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.09,0:17:15.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NBe careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.31,0:17:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We split up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.22,0:17:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NWe vow to the\NGreat Warrior Kalgara
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.18,0:17:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:32.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GEDATSU, OHM, SHURA]\N– So the Shandorian's\N– So the Shandorian's
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.98,0:17:34.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,have come for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:40.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSpeaks for itself pretty well.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at it. It's almost unreal.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBut it's no fairy tale.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would this be here?\NIt looks exactly the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like a copy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.22,0:17:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NBut it's not.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.53,0:17:57.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHow do you figure?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.95,0:18:00.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the other half\Nof what we saw before.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.28,0:18:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NGo on.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.49,0:18:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's bugged me for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.65,0:18:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why is it that we walk on soil\Nhere instead of island cloud?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.70,0:18:08.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This dirt.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in the makeup\Nof the White White Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that would allow\Nfor its existence.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.91,0:18:14.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... the ground that\Nwe're walking on
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.00,0:18:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,shouldn't exist up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.50,0:18:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard was originally\Non the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.91,0:18:23.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI knew that house\Nwas off when I saw it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.83,0:18:26.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thing is, it's a\Ntwo-story house,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.58,0:18:30.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and there was no staircase\Nleading up to the second story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what would make you build\Na house on the edge of a cliff?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.31,0:18:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But then again,\Nit wasn't a cliff at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY, USOPP]\N– Whoa! Amazing!\N– Whoa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.39,0:18:42.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]\NLook closer.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's really unattractive.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.95,0:18:47.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A guy's gotta have some serious\Nguts to build a house that ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.28,0:18:52.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThis isn't a palace at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.16,0:19:01.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThis is the half of the\Nisland that was ripped away.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.46,0:19:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThis island\Nused to be part of Jaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.51,0:19:11.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSo what that means\Nis a few hundred years back,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.10,0:19:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the island below\Nus split in half
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and one side of it\Nrose into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOUTH BIRD squawks]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NEither of you know\Nhow that coulda happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOUTH BIRDS squawking]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.78,0:19:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're... South Birds.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A whole flock of 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.82,0:19:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're huge.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they got so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]\NAll right.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.89,0:19:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, would you wake up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds ridiculous,\Nbut that's the best I can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.89,0:20:01.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNo singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SOUTH BIRD squawking]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.03,0:20:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThe City of Gold that\NNoland discovered on the ground
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,didn't sink into the\Nocean like he guessed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.45,0:20:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This part of Jaya...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.87,0:20:22.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been floating in\Nthe sky for 400 years!
